title: '[RWF] `sc-consensus-slots`: fix integer overflow in `should_backoff` near
  `u64::MAX` slots'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Closes #12460

    ### Problem

    `BackoffAuthoringOnFinalizedHeadLagging::should_backoff` computed the backoff threshold with a plain `u64` addition. When `chain_head_slot` is near `u64::MAX` and interval is non-zero, this overflows.

    ### Fix
    Replace the unchecked addition with `saturating_add`, which clamps the result at `u64::MAX` instead of wrapping:
crates:
- name: sc-consensus-slots
  bump: patch
